            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Would you accept a patch to 0.12 to silence these errors but is never merged to master? I didn't see these issues on 0.11, so it'd be great if they were resolved in the stable branch.\n\nNo. All development goes through `master`, and fixes are backported as appropriate. No exceptions. (And `master`/0.13 will become the \"stable branch\" soon.)\n\nEven if you don't use nightly for production work (which is a very sensible policy!) you should still _test_ it (using the provided binaries) to verify an issue you're having. (Ideally _before_ opening an issue; maintainer time is at a premium.)",
